<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="overmap_editor.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- place_ter_or_special editor panel (overmap_ui::place_ter_or_special). A passive
         doc over the map, replacing the curses w_editor box. The #editor element is
         filled each redraw by place_ter_or_special's on_redraw (terrain/special id,
         rotation, the red-areas warning, and the rotate/apply/cancel controls). Anchored
         upper-right so the placement cursor on the map stays visible. Dev/wizard tool. -->
    <div class="panel ome-panel">
        <div id="editor" class="ome-text"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
